       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "11896313"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Variations in the ART4 gene are the basis of the Dombrock blood group system (Do). ART4 carries two antithetical antigens (Do(a) and Do(b)) and 3 high-incidence antigens, Gregory (Gy(a)), Holley (Hy), and Joseph (Jo(a)). Do(a) and Do(b) differ by a single variation at position 265, with Asn-265 corresponding to Do(a) and Asp-265 (shown in this entry) to Do(b)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "POLYMORPHISM"
